    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of a classic Soviet locomotive, discover the raw beauty and wildness of Siberia and try to survive on the longest railway line in the world. This is the Trans-Siberian Railway Simulator. A game for real adventurers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/74e144ad2ae2fbb3c63e7cf96c67eddd.poster.avif?t=1751022427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/74e144ad2ae2fbb3c63e7cf96c67eddd.webm?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/74e144ad2ae2fbb3c63e7cf96c67eddd.mp4?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the tutorial and the first kilometers of the route for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/68375d95721a72c760411fdae3cf6db1.poster.avif?t=1751022427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/68375d95721a72c760411fdae3cf6db1.webm?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/68375d95721a72c760411fdae3cf6db1.mp4?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trans-Siberian Railway Simulator offers amazing rail and survival challenges on real Russian dangerous routes. Feel what it is like to put your hands at the helm of a powerful freight locomotive and explore the untouched natural landscape that is sure to delight you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/00e4347b545e4f0027744270928fc700.poster.avif?t=1751022427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/00e4347b545e4f0027744270928fc700.webm?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/00e4347b545e4f0027744270928fc700.mp4?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Detailed simulation of driving a VL10 locomotive - the locomotive control is slightly simplified.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Locomotive repair system - Manage and replace locomotive parts that are constantly wearing out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Train traffic simulation - Follow rail signs and signals to avoid derailment or damage to a part of the locomotive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Work system - Earn by completing transport orders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game modes (Survival) and (Simulator). It is recommended to play in the (Survival) mode. This is the leading game mode that is constantly being developed. <br>For players who are not interested in survival mechanics, a simple Simulator mode is available. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mafia system - Complete missions for the mafia to earn extra money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival system with statistics of hunger, thirst, alcohol, hangover, disease and hypothermia - Eat and drink to avoid death. <br>Keep the right temperature so you don't freeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shooting system - Use your weapons for hunting and self-defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Purchase and sales system - Buy various items, food, tools, weapons and ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Locomotive inspection mode - Inspect the condition of locomotive parts and replace them in time to avoid damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic weather system with day and night cycle - Survive extreme weather conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Route from (Novosibirsk-West) to (Novosibirsk-Main) - scale 1:1. Buy the full version with the route from (Novosibirsk-West) to (Krasnoyarsk).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Police system - A corrupt militia watches over your movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Much more to discover.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of a classic Soviet locomotive, discover the raw beauty and wildness of Siberia and try to survive on the longest railway line in the world. This is the Trans-Siberian Railway Simulator. A game for real adventurers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/74e144ad2ae2fbb3c63e7cf96c67eddd.poster.avif?t=1751022427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/74e144ad2ae2fbb3c63e7cf96c67eddd.webm?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/74e144ad2ae2fbb3c63e7cf96c67eddd.mp4?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the tutorial and the first kilometers of the route for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/68375d95721a72c760411fdae3cf6db1.poster.avif?t=1751022427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/68375d95721a72c760411fdae3cf6db1.webm?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/68375d95721a72c760411fdae3cf6db1.mp4?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trans-Siberian Railway Simulator offers amazing rail and survival challenges on real Russian dangerous routes. Feel what it is like to put your hands at the helm of a powerful freight locomotive and explore the untouched natural landscape that is sure to delight you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/00e4347b545e4f0027744270928fc700.poster.avif?t=1751022427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/00e4347b545e4f0027744270928fc700.webm?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248950/extras/00e4347b545e4f0027744270928fc700.mp4?t=1751022427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Detailed simulation of driving a VL10 locomotive - the locomotive control is slightly simplified.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Locomotive repair system - Manage and replace locomotive parts that are constantly wearing out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Train traffic simulation - Follow rail signs and signals to avoid derailment or damage to a part of the locomotive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Work system - Earn by completing transport orders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game modes (Survival) and (Simulator). It is recommended to play in the (Survival) mode. This is the leading game mode that is constantly being developed. <br>For players who are not interested in survival mechanics, a simple Simulator mode is available. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mafia system - Complete missions for the mafia to earn extra money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival system with statistics of hunger, thirst, alcohol, hangover, disease and hypothermia - Eat and drink to avoid death. <br>Keep the right temperature so you don't freeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shooting system - Use your weapons for hunting and self-defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Purchase and sales system - Buy various items, food, tools, weapons and ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Locomotive inspection mode - Inspect the condition of locomotive parts and replace them in time to avoid damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic weather system with day and night cycle - Survive extreme weather conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Route from (Novosibirsk-West) to (Novosibirsk-Main) - scale 1:1. Buy the full version with the route from (Novosibirsk-West) to (Krasnoyarsk).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Police system - A corrupt militia watches over your movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Much more to discover.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take control of a Soviet locomotive and battle wild animals, bandits, severe frost, and constant mechanical breakdowns as you cross the world\u2019s longest railway. How far will you get?",
